List inline review threads on a pull request, including resolved state. Returns GraphQL review thread nodes, including comment bodies and resolution metadata. Docs: https://docs.github.com/en/graphql/reference/objects#pullrequestreviewthread. This tool is part of plugins `Codex Security`, `GitHub`.

